        "caption": "All three Rutgers locations earned their highest public university rankings from U.S. News & World Report: \n\n\ud83d\udd34 Rutgers\u2013New Brunswick: #14 Public \n\ud83d\udd34 Rutgers\u2013Newark: #32 Public \n\ud83d\udd34 Rutgers\u2013Camden: #43 Public\n \nEvery Rutgers campus is again placed in the Top 50 public and Top 100 national universities, reflecting our sustained investment in academic excellence, access, and student success.\n\nLink in bio for the full story. \n \n#Rutgers #HigherEd #CollegeRankings #RutgersPride",
