      {
        "caption": "Big things R happening at the New Jersey State House, where Sir Henry, Scarlet Raider, and Scarlet Raptor traded campus for the Capitol on Tuesday. \n\nThe legendary trio made themselves right at home, roaming the halls, making friends, and showing off true Rutgers Pride - all while taking cool pictures.\n \nTogether, the trio represents Rutgers' statewide impact. A massive financial engine for the state, Rutgers generates $13.3 billion in annual economic impact. Every $1 NJ invests in Rutgers yields $11.49 in return, supporting 69,239 jobs statewide and injecting nearly $1 billion into research annually.\n\nOne State University. Three mascots. One State House. A whole lot of Jersey pride.\n \nThanks so much for the hospitality, @njgov. Felt like home. #rutgerspride",
